{title: 078 - For God So Loved Us}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: God the Father}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
For God so loved us,
He sent the Savior:
For God so loved us,
and loves me too.

Refrain:
Love so unending!
I'll sing His praises,
God loves His children,
loves even me.

Verse 2:
He sent the Savior,
the blest Redeemer;
He sent the Savior
to set me free.

Verse 3:
He bade me welcome,
O word of mercy;
He bade me welcome,
O voice divine.

Verse 4:
Glory and honor,
O Love eternal,
To Him be given
while life shall last.
